  SIG -->|upload to ONE mirror| M0
  TS --> M0
  CL["client<br/>root chain -> timestamp (freeze, rollback)<br/>-> signatures -> hashes -> Merkle root<br/>-> licence -> log proofs"]
  M0 & M1 & M2 & M3 -->|any mirror, untrusted| CL
  LOG -->|STH + proofs| CL
